+// Shared constants (bytes):
+//   0 texture descriptor indices, [2D, 3D, Cube, 1D][32 fetch slots]
+// 512 sampler descriptor indices [32]
+// 640 bool constants as the hardware addresses them (VS b0-127, PS b128-255)
+// 672 swapped texcoords, 676 alpha threshold, 680 half pixel offset
+// 688 guest memory base: GPU address of guest physical address 0 (vertex data
