+// 696 the 96 vertex fetch constants, 2 dwords each as the GPU sees them
+// 1464 16 declared vertex elements (uint4 each): fetch constant index,
+//     offset and stride in dwords, format | signed << 8 | integer << 9 |
+//     swap red/blue << 11
+// 1720 NDC transform (float4): oPos.xy = oPos.xy * xy + zw * oPos.w; identity
